      "prompt": "我剛註冊完，要怎麼開第一場直播？",
      "context": {
        "role": "owner",
        "summary": "全新商家：尚未設定客服 Email、沒有商品、報名表單、Email 模板、影片或直播。",
        "signals": {
          "supportEmailConfigured": false,
          "sellableProductCount": 0,
          "activeFormCount": 0,
          "registrationEmailTemplateCount": 0,
          "readyVideoCount": 0,
          "sellableLiveCount": 0
        }
      },
      "mustInclude": [
